        T4_owned_arg_consumes, T4_iter_consume_arg_consumes,
        T4_borrowed_arg_reads, T4_passthrough_consume_credit_nets_zero,
        T4_sharing_view_credits_source, T4_boundary_places_no_release,
        T4_owned_boundary_matches_rl34,
        T4_owned_param_births_callee_ledger (P1)
      calleeOpening, calleeLedger, calleeConforms, calleeLedger_borrowed,
        calleeConforms_interface, clauseFloors_mono (P2)
      boundaryInstrs_mutate_free, caller_summary_split,
        threeClauses_substitute_segment,
        T4_contract_boundary_composition_sound (P3 - the load-bearing
        theorem), T4_contract_boundary_composition_safe (P3)
      t4UF, t4ClassOf, t4BcOwned, t4BcMis, t4CalleeBody, t4PreI, t4PostMis,
        T4_owned_arg_misclassified_borrowed_rejected,
        T4_live_at_call_side_condition_necessary (P4)
      T4_contract_boundary_bundle (conclusion bundle)
    Bridged committed theorems and carriers consumed: TerminalUse,
      rl2_use_transfers_ownership, rl34_action, TailCallAction
      (AimsProof.Realization); AccessClass (AimsProof.Model); ParamContract
      (AimsProof.Interprocedural); LedgerInstr, LedgerEvent, deriveLedger,
      threeClauses, ledgerSafe, ledgerNet, clauseFloors, runLedger,
