    The compiled Lean (verified by `lake build` under the trusted kernel) is the
    authoritative calculus; this .proof is the human-readable companion.

    Engines dispatched:
      interprocedural_summary (PRIMARY - the per-param contract as the
        composition interface; caller summary vs callee conformance)
      rc_counting (running-count fold over the composed per-class ledger;
        net-equal substitution + floor decomposition obligations)
