  Expected:
    status: unimplemented_engine_shape
    reason: IC contract-boundary-composition shape outside the rule-numbered IC verifier inventory (the IC dischargers serve the numbered IC-1..IC-8a suffixes only). The authoritative machine-check is the compiled Lean AimsProof.ContractBoundary (lake build clean): T4_contract_boundary_composition_sound discharges the contract-classified boundary composition - caller three-clause ledger with the computed summary plus callee conformance under the contract-mandated BIRTH/borrow opening compose into a three-clause inlined ledger without callee re-derivation - over the committed RL-2 twelve-kind table and the T1 partition representatives, with the owned-arg-misclassified-borrowed double-release and the dead-call-site use-after-free rejections.
